&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(退職給付関係)&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;１．採用している退職給付制度の概要&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当社は、退職金規程に基づく&lt;/span&gt;退職一時金&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;制度を採用しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;退職給付に係る負債及び退職給付費用の計算に、退職給付に係る期末自己都合要支給額を退職給付債務とする方法を用いた簡便法を適用しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２．確定給付制度&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;(1) 簡便法を適用した制度の、退職給付に係る負債の期首残高と期末残高の調整表&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:359.2pt;"&gt;（百万円）&lt;/p&gt;
